  "pass_cookies": {
    "about": "The browser check's pass cookie (SPEC.md section 5, step 7), as the gate finds it in the Cookie header: split at ; and at , (a runtime may join several Cookie fields with \", \"), every piece named cookie_name a candidate, tried from the last (the real one is set just before the check page reloads, so browsers send it after one planted earlier or on a longer path), and only the last 8 distinct candidates that are well formed and within the times get an HMAC. The token is pass_tokens[0]'s, checked at now (unix seconds) with max_age_seconds. has_pass: the request passes without the browser check.",
